{"4393450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "LOOK UP AND GO", "steam_appid": 4393450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4805360], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393450/extras/9a2fd91b89a86482a1c49402e980da76.avif?t=1787340355\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393450/extras/3f7eae666a4bdd7a47d9092bddc2ec1c.avif?t=1787340355\" width=1200 height=150 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will start with 100 points in your <strong><u>Bank</u></strong>. Your Bank points determine your spot on the leader board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use points from your <strong><u>Bank</u></strong> to bet on yourself surviving the run and beating your best combo.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you make it to the top of the tower, the points you earned are multiplied by the points you wagered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you die on the run, you lose the points that you wagered, and have to buy your life back with points from your <strong><u>Bank</u></strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you don't or can't buy your life back, you will be permanently deleted from the leader board.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393450/extras/3bb3d4838f1618837dfa6d35762aa471.avif?t=1787340355\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393450/extras_big/3bb3d4838f1618837dfa6d35762aa471.avif?t=1787340355 width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393450/extras/f41a29b118a4612ab2faa22888fadd8d.avif?t=1787340355\" width=1200 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide how many points from your <strong><u>Bank</u></strong> you will bring into your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide how many points from your <strong><u>Bank</u></strong> you will use to make other players' runs harder.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393450/extras/c3ed30d11c0ffdfefbe5928d4548ff09.avif?t=1787340355\" width=1200 height=150 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >String together combos to earn more points.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combos are multiplied by the points you brought into your run.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn more points by getting kills close to the rising water.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rising water will kill you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turrets' projectiles will kill you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ram will kill you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not die.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393450/extras/3550d712327a6978c1a2ff74fac9b1c0.avif?t=1787340355\" width=1200 height=150 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will lose the points you brought with you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to buy back your life with points from your <strong><u>Bank</u></strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you cannot afford to buy back your life, you will be eliminated from the leader board.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393450/extras/88233f2e9fc4c11ee19a5d74f9fde212.avif?t=1787340355\" width=1200 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may double down and run again.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may put the points you earned into your <strong><u>Bank</u></strong>, which will move you up the leader board.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may take a deep breath.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393450/extras/24507488074a01942d0814efab9fd474.avif?t=1787340355\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393450/extras_big/24507488074a01942d0814efab9fd474.avif?t=1787340355 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>You will stab so you can fire rockets.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>You will fire rockets so you can do tricks.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>You will do tricks so you can stab.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>You will not die.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>You will climb.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>You will ascend.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>You will</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393450/extr