3450/extras/f41a29b118a4612ab2faa22888fadd8d.avif?t=1787340355\" width=1200 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide how many points from your <strong><u>Bank</u></strong> you will bring into your run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decide how many points from your <strong><u>Bank</u></strong> you will use to make other players' runs harder.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393450/extras/c3ed30d11c0ffdfefbe5928d4548ff09.avif?t=1787340355\" width=1200 height=150 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >String together combos to earn more points.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combos are multiplied by the points you brought into your run.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn more points by getting kills close to the rising water.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rising water will kill you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turrets' projectiles will kill you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ram will kill you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do not die.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4393450/extras/3550d712327a6978c1a2ff74fac9b1c0.avif?t=1787340355\" width=1200 height=150 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will lose the points you brought with you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to buy back your life with points from your <strong><u>Bank</u></strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you cannot afford to buy back your life, you will be eliminated from the leader board.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" s